      "transform": 2,
      "knownFor": "A Phylosian primary contact who treats Hikaru Sulu after a retlaw plant bite and follows Stavos Keniclius 5, voiced by James Doohan.",
      "reveal": "The frozen role source names James Doohan in the actor field and states that Agmar was voiced by James Doohan. This supports a voice-only performance claim for Agmar in The Infinite Vulcan (1973). Stavos Keniclius 5, Lieutenant Arex, and White Rabbit remain separate character and performer roles. The fictional Voder used by Phylosians is an in-story device and does not establish real-world sound processing. The exact role-specific still of Agmar is retained as character evidence, while a separately sourced public-domain photograph supports Doohan’s identity. No physical performance, animation, character design, voice direction, editing, sound processing, vocal transformation, production-shop, or other maker credit is inferred.",
